{"text":"kuruntokai","n":116,"lines":["யானயந் துறைவோள் தேம்பாய் கூந்தல்","வளங்கெழு சோழர் உறந்தைப் பெருந்துறை","நுண்மணல் அறல்வார்ந் தன்ன","நன்னெறி யவ்வே நறுந்தண் ணியவே"],"tr":["yāṉayan tuṟaivōḷ tēmpāy kūntal","vaḷaṅkeḻu cōḻar uṟantaip peruntuṟai","nuṇmaṇal aṟalvārn taṉṉa","naṉṉeṟi yavvē naṟuntaṇ ṇiyavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"இளங்கீரனார்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Iḷaṅkīraṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 8, āciriyattaḷai 6"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"யானயந்","tr":"yāṉayan","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னயந்","tr":"ṉayan"}]},{"text":"துறைவோள்","tr":"tuṟaivōḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறை","tr":"tuṟai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வோள்","tr":"vōḷ"}]},{"text":"தேம்பாய்","tr":"tēmpāy","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தேம்","tr":"tēm"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பாய்","tr":"pāy"}]},{"text":"கூந்தல்","tr":"kūntal","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூந்","tr":"kūn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தல்","tr":"tal"}]}],[{"text":"வளங்கெழு","tr":"vaḷaṅkeḻu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வளங்","tr":"vaḷaṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கெழு","tr":"keḻu"}]},{"text":"சோழர்","tr":"cōḻar","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சோ","tr":"cō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழர்","tr":"ḻar"}]},{"text":"உறந்தைப்","tr":"uṟantaip","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உறந்","tr":"uṟan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தைப்","tr":"taip"}]},{"text":"பெருந்துறை","tr":"peruntuṟai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருந்","tr":"perun"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறை","tr":"tuṟai"}]}],[{"text":"நுண்மணல்","tr":"nuṇmaṇal","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நுண்","tr":"nuṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மணல்","tr":"maṇal"}]},{"text":"அறல்வார்ந்","tr":"aṟalvārn","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அறல்","tr":"aṟal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வார்ந்","tr":"vārn"}]},{"text":"தன்ன","tr":"taṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]}],[{"text":"நன்னெறி","tr":"naṉṉeṟi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னெறி","tr":"ṉeṟi"}]},{"text":"யவ்வே","tr":"yavvē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யவ்","tr":"yav"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]},{"text":"நறுந்தண்","tr":"naṟuntaṇ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நறுந்","tr":"naṟun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"}]},{"text":"ணியவே","tr":"ṇiyavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணிய","tr":"ṇiya"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"யான்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I"},{"surface":"நயந்து","parts":[{"text":"நயந்து","lemma":"நய","gloss":"having desired"}],"gloss":"lovingly"},{"surface":"உறைவோள்","parts":[{"text":"உறை","lemma":"உறை","gloss":"reside"},{"text":"ஓள்","lemma":"அவள்","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"she who resides with me"},{"surface":"தேம்பாய்","parts":[{"text":"தேம்","lemma":"தேம்","gloss":"honey"},{"text":"பாய்","lemma":"பாய்","gloss":"flowing"}],"gloss":"honey-dripping"},{"surface":"கூந்தல்","parts":[{"text":"கூந்தல்","lemma":"கூந்தல்","gloss":"tresses"}],"gloss":"tresses"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வளங்கெழு","parts":[{"text":"வளம்","lemma":"வளம்","gloss":"wealth"},{"text":"கெழு","lemma":"கெழு","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"wealth-possessing"},{"surface":"சோழர்","parts":[{"text":"சோழர்","lemma":"சோழர்","gloss":"Cholas"}],"gloss":"of the Cholas"},{"surface":"உறந்தைப்","parts":[{"text":"உறந்தைப்","lemma":"உறந்தைப்","gloss":"of Uraiyur"}],"gloss":"of Uraiyur","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெருந்துறை","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்துறை","lemma":"பெருந்துறை","gloss":"great riverbank"}],"gloss":"great riverbank","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நுண்மணல்","parts":[{"text":"நுண்","lemma":"நுண்","gloss":"fine"},{"text":"மணல்","lemma":"மணல்","gloss":"sand"}],"gloss":"fine sand"},{"surface":"அறல்வார்ந்தன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அறல்","lemma":"அறல்","gloss":"black sand ripples"},{"text":"வார்ந்து","lemma":"வார்","gloss":"having flowed"},{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like the flowing black sand ripples"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நன்னெறியவ்வே","parts":[{"text":"நன்னெறியவ்வே","lemma":"நன்னெறியவ்வே","gloss":"they have beautiful curls"}],"gloss":"they have beautiful curls","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நறுந்தண்ணியவே","parts":[{"text":"நறும்","lemma":"நறும்","gloss":"fragrant"},{"text":"தண்ணிய","lemma":"தண்ணிய","gloss":"cool things"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"they are fragrant and cool"}]}],"literal":"I, having desired, she who resides, her honey-dripping tresses / of the wealth-possessing Cholas' Uraiyur's great riverbank / fine sand's black ripples spread out like / have beautiful curls, are fragrant and cool.","translation":"The honey-dripping tresses of her whom I love and live with are like the dark, wavy lines of water-ripples on the fine sands of the great riverbank of Uraiyur, belonging to the wealthy Cholas. They have beautiful curls; they are fragrant and cool.","modern":"நான் விரும்பி வாழ்கின்ற தலைவியின் தேன் சொட்டும் கூந்தல், வளம் பொருந்திய சோழர்களது உறந்தையின் பெரிய காவிரித் துறையிலுள்ள நுண்மையான மணலில் நீர் வடியும்போது ஏற்படும் கருமணல் வரிகளைப் போன்றது. அக்கூந்தல் அழகிய நெளிவுகளை உடையது; நறுமணமும் குளிர்ச்சியும் பொருந்தியது.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the hero in the Kuriñci tiṇai, expressing his deep love and admiration for the heroine's beauty. He describes her hair, which is fragrant and cool, comparing its dark, wavy texture to the natural patterns formed on the riverbank. Specifically, he likens her curls to the dark sand ripples left by receding water on the fine sands of the Kaveri river at Uraiyur, the prosperous capital of the Cholas. This vivid comparison of her hair to a famous, beautiful landscape highlights her exceptional grace and high status. The key words 'நயந்து' (lovingly), 'அறல்' (black sand ripples), and 'நறுந்தண்ணியவே' (fragrant and cool) emphasize the sensory richness of his love.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,1.8],[1.8,2.9],[2.9,3.4],[3.4,3.6],[3.6,4.3],[4.3,4.9],[4.9,5.32],[5.32,5.4],[5.4,7.31],[7.31,7.49],[7.49,7.49],[7.49,8.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,1.8],[1.8,1.9],[1.9,3.07],[3.3,3.8],[3.8,4.0],[4.0,4.8],[4.8,5.6],[5.6,6.18],[6.18,6.3],[6.3,7.17],[7.17,7.6],[7.6,7.6],[7.6,8.9]]}}